 So the idea is like that any calorie is the same, right?

00:37:21.470 --> 00:37:26.730
 But like I lived in Mexico for a number of years and like rice and tortillas are not the

00:37:26.730 --> 00:37:31.990
 same thing in people's imaginations and they don't fill them up in the same way, right?

00:37:32.070 --> 00:37:32.270
 Yeah.

00:37:32.410 --> 00:37:39.440
 And so in prison, when you don't have any control over anything that you eat, right?

00:37:39.500 --> 00:37:42.560
 You just are supposed to eat whatever shows up to you.

