 all together, you know, a new thing because they're hungry and, and that they're trying

00:45:06.910 --> 00:45:09.750
 to survive, yes, eat and consume.

00:45:09.750 --> 00:45:19.230
 Um, but I also thought it was an important idea that that little space of putting together

