 and creating and, and, and I call it gourmeting a little bit, you know, to give it that value,

00:45:25.090 --> 00:45:33.020
 um, that they have that freedom, you know, it's like you said, they, they're, they're made

00:45:33.020 --> 00:45:34.160
 to, they're given certain things.

