00:46:10.600 --> 00:46:13.290
 find a way to survive.

00:46:13.290 --> 00:46:20.150
 We will find a way to, uh, create and it talks to me in that sense, to the human spirit,

00:46:20.150 --> 00:46:25.670
 you know, of, of the resilience of, you know, in, in whatever situation, of course, this

