00:51:35.570 --> 00:51:37.220
 it's a way to try that.

00:51:37.320 --> 00:51:38.680
 And food is just great, right?

00:51:38.680 --> 00:51:40.300
 Because it brings people together.

00:51:40.300 --> 00:51:43.290
 It talks, everybody needs to eat.

00:51:43.700 --> 00:51:49.060
 And in this project, I mean, this is related working with prisoners, but in other projects

00:51:49.060 --> 00:51:53.870
 and stuff that I do, if I'm working with a different group, let's say, you know, different

00:51:53.870 --> 00:52:00.180
 group of people, seniors or disabled people, whatever mentally ill people, I, my approach

00:52:00.180 --> 00:52:09.820
 is always to try to figure out, you know, that common sort of way that you are, it's almost

00:52:09.820 --> 00:52:12.270
 like a strategy, like a magician, right?

00:52:12.330 --> 00:52:13.290
 You have to see the hat.

00:52:13.370 --> 00:52:14.080
 Here's the hat.

00:52:14.080 --> 00:52:20.590
 And then you're sort of like doing all these things around, but there is the hat, you know,

00:52:20.610 --> 00:52:22.410
 this is the open space.

00:52:23.160 --> 00:52:29.100
 And I think the strategy has always been that if any project that I do, there has to be multiple

00:52:29.100 --> 00:52:30.280
 ways of engagement.

00:52:30.790 --> 00:52:31.490
 Do you know what I mean?

00:52:31.770 --> 00:52:39.280
 Because if it's just one way, you know, I, what else else to explore?

00:52:39.440 --> 00:52:40.280
 You're going to get bored.

00:52:40.660 --> 00:52:41.540
 We're going to get bored.

00:52:41.660 --> 00:52:41.780
 Yeah.

00:52:42.020 --> 00:52:42.360
 Yeah.

00:52:42.500 --> 00:52:48.920
 And I try to do it the lightest way I can, uh, in terms of talking about the, the kind

00:52:48.920 --> 00:52:52.290
 of, and it's a big, it's an important issue, right?

00:52:52.290 --> 00:52:59.370
 It's a heavy issues, but, but how do I, you know, begin to talk about this subject so that

00:52:59.370 --> 00:53:04.470
 they begin to talk about it so that they have their own entryway or approach or point of

00:53:04.470 --> 00:53:06.730
 view, because that's, what's going to happen.

00:53:06.850 --> 00:53:11.390
 You know, if you don't agree with me, I'm never going to, I'm never want to change your

00:53:11.390 --> 00:53:11.670
 mind.

00:53:11.770 --> 00:53:13.170
 You have, you have experience.

00:53:13.550 --> 00:53:15.650
 We're going to, this is going to happen.

00:53:15.650 --> 00:53:22.550
 So that's what I, when I would have the performances and stuff, I would come to them and people

00:53:22.550 --> 00:53:24.850
 that would come and be like, yeah, they deserve that.

00:53:24.910 --> 00:53:25.110
 Yeah.

00:53:25.210 --> 00:53:25.970
 You know, whatever.

00:53:26.610 --> 00:53:32.610
 Uh, I would be like, okay, your perspective, respected, you know, that's great.

00:53:32.750 --> 00:53:35.540
 You know, I'm not showing you anything or I'm not disagreeing.

00:53:35.540 --> 00:53:38.220
 I'm just showing you, look, there's this food thing, right?

00:53:38.790 --> 00:53:45.550
 And here I am in front of, with this like spray paint and garbage bags or whatever, like

00:53:45.550 --> 00:53:47.030
 it's, it's, it's a performance.

00:53:47.030 --> 00:53:50.800
 It's ridiculous sort of into, that's kind of the point, right?

00:53:51.750 --> 00:53:52.010
 Yeah.

00:53:52.170 --> 00:53:58.780
 And I think, um, so I think there's always a way to be able to have, cause I think to

00:53:58.780 --> 00:54:05.710
 me, you know, when I see stuff, when I, I, I, when I open up about my things or a different

00:54:05.710 --> 00:54:08.660
 perspective, I'm more receptive towards it.

00:54:08.760 --> 00:54:12.910
 If it's in that way, you know, I was like, oh yeah, that's interesting.

00:54:13.030 --> 00:54:13.850
 Oh, that's funny.

00:54:13.950 --> 00:54:14.370
 Oh yeah.

00:54:14.470 --> 00:54:15.810
 Oh, you got me there, you know?

00:54:16.190 --> 00:54:20.000
 And I think that's an opening door for anybody.

00:54:20.350 --> 00:54:21.730
 I think that's true.

00:54:21.930 --> 00:54:22.130
 Yeah.

00:54:22.170 --> 00:54:23.490
 But thank you so much.

00:54:23.490 --> 00:54:25.710
 Yeah, that was, that was really great.

00:54:25.910 --> 00:54:27.890
 I have a conversation about this.

00:54:27.990 --> 00:54:35.630
 It's a very, I think more, uh, insightful conversation that I've had about this, but yeah, thank

00:54:35.630 --> 00:54:36.490
 you so much for you too.

00:54:36.920 --> 00:54:37.260
 Yeah.

00:54:37.320 --> 00:54:38.300
 Thank you.

00:54:38.500 --> 00:54:39.660
 Great to talk to you.

